= \n| first      = [[The Titan of the Stage]]\n| last       = \n}}'''Todd''' was the lead singer of the rock band Monsterok and a [[Seeker]] who belonged to a distant branch of the [[Casterwill family]]. He had a [[Titan]] called [[Thunderok]].\n\n== History ==\nTodd was kidnapped by [[the Organization]] so that he would give them the location of [[Thunderok]]'s [[Amulet]]. Upon being rescued by the [[Huntik Foundation]] team, he invoked [[Thunderok]] to dispatch [[Lee Roy]]'s Titans, [[Bonelasher]] and [[Executioner]]. {{Source|The Titan's Stage}}\n\n== Titans Bonded ==\n* [[Thunderok]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family members]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]","categories":["Casterwill family members","Characters","Seekers"],"links":[{"target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwill family","target_id":"huntik:page:3280","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_title":"The Titan of the Stage","label":"The Titan of the Stage","target_id":"huntik:page:12996","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Titan_of_the_Stage","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A12996"},{"target_title":"Seeker","label":"Seeker","target_id":"huntik:page:1997","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Seeker","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1997"},{"target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwill family","target_id":"huntik:page:3280","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_title":"Titan","label":"Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2010","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2010"},{"target_title":"Thunderok","label":"Thunderok","target_id":"huntik:page:17046","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Thunderok","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A17046"},{"target_title":"the Organization